      "info": "Controls an EBYTE MA01-AXCX4040 board (4 digital inputs, 4 relays) over Modbus RTU on RS-485. Press the button next to an inject node to switch a relay on or off (function 5, coils 0 to 3) or all four at once (function 15). The relay state is read every 5 s (function 1) and the inputs every 30 s (function 2). Before deploying, set the serial port, baud rate and unit ID of the board in the Modbus connection."
